{"speciesId":155,"names":{"fr":"Héricendre","es":"Cyndaquil","en":"Cyndaquil","ja":"ヒノアラシ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It is timid, and always curls it­ self up in a ball. If attacked, it flares up its back for protection."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It usually stays hunched over. If it is angry or surprised, it shoots flames out of its back."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"The fire that spouts from its back burns hottest when it is angry. The flaring flames intimidate foes."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"CYNDAQUIL protects itself by flaring up the flames on its back. The flames are vigorous if the POKéMON is angry. However, if it is tired, the flames splutter fitfully with incomplete combustion."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"CYNDAQUIL protects itself by flaring up the flames on its back. The flames are vigorous if the POKéMON is angry. However, if it is tired, the flames splutter fitfully with incomplete combustion."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It flares flames from its back to protect itself. The fire burns vigorously if the POKéMON is angry. When it is tired, it sputters with incomplete combustion."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It usually stays hunched over. If it is angry or surprised, it shoots flames out of its back."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It is timid and always curls itself up in a ball. If attacked, it flares up its back for protection."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It has a timid nature. If it is startled, the flames on its back burn more vigorously."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It has a timid nature. If it is startled, the flames on its back burn more vigorously."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It has a timid nature. If it is startled, the flames on its back burn more vigorously."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It is timid, and always curls itself up in a ball. If attacked, it flares up its back for protection."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It usually stays hunched over. If it is angry or surprised, it shoots flames out of its back."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ce Pokémon est un grand timide. Les flammes sur son dos s’intensifient lorsqu’il prend peur."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It has a timid nature. If it is startled, the flames on its back burn more vigorously."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ce Pokémon est un grand timide. Les flammes sur son dos s’intensifient lorsqu’il prend peur."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It has a timid nature. If it is startled, the flames on its back burn more vigorously."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It has a timid nature. If it is startled, the flames on its back burn more vigorously."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It has a timid nature. If it is startled, the flames on its back burn more vigorously."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il est timide et se roule en boule pour se protéger. Attaqué, il s’enflamme le dos pour riposter."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Es tímido y siempre se enrosca como una pelota. Si es atacado, enciende su lomo para protegerse."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It is timid and always curls itself up in a ball. If attacked, it flares up its back for protection."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"臆病で いつも 体を まるめている。 襲われると 背中の 炎を 燃え上がらせて 身を守る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ce Pokémon est un grand timide. Les flammes sur son dos s’intensifient lorsqu’il prend peur."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Es un Pokémon muy tímido. Si se asusta, las llamas de su lomo arden con más fuerza."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It has a timid nature. If it is startled, the flames on its back burn more vigorously."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"臆病な 性格。 驚くと 背中の 炎が 一段と 強く 燃え上がる。"},{"la